{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2021-12-01 10:46:00', 'title': 'GM AND POSCO CHEMICAL WILL BUILD A NEW NORTH AMERICA FACTORY TO PROCESS CATHODE ACTIVE MATERIAL FOR ULTIUM BATTERIES', 'text': "DETROIT, DEC. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENERAL MOTORS (NYSE: GM) AND POSCO CHEMICAL TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO FORM A JOINT VENTURE THROUGH WHICH THE PARTIES WILL CONSTRUCT A FACTORY IN NORTH AMERICA TO PROCESS CRITICAL BATTERY MATERIALS FOR GM'S ULTIUM ELECTRIC VEHICLE PLATFORM. THE JOINT VENTURE\xa0WILL PROCESS CATHODE ACTIVE MATERIAL (CAM), A KEY BATTERY MATERIAL THAT REPRESENTS ABOUT 40 PERCENT OF THE COST OF A BATTERY CELL."}